hts/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"yes"},"382":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-104","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"What the columns mean:"},"383":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-105","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**Read** — open the Project, its threads, files, artifacts, agents, skills, flows, runs."},"384":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-106","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**Write · run · invoke** — send a message, upload a file, edit a draft agent or flow, run a flow, use a tool."},"385":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-107","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**Delete · administer · export** — archive the Project, add and remove members, change its governance, export\ncontent (an export of *DSK* or above also needs a stated purpose)."},"386":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-108","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**Publish** — make an agent, skill or flow version *published* — the human review the platform requires\nbefore anything runs on a schedule or is offered to others. Only the owner; never an administrator from outside,\nnever an agent."},"387":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-109","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**Approve** — decide an approval request a run is parked on (see below)."},"388":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-110","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"Two things the table implies that people ask about:"},"389":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-111","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**An editor cannot publish.** Taras, editor of *Autumn catalogue*, can author a new agent and a new flow, run\nthem as drafts, and hand them to Olena; the *Publish* button is refused for him. This is the review gate, not a\nlimitation to work around."},"390":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-112","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#project-relations","content":"**An organization administrator cannot write in a Project from outside.** Olena can add or remove members of\nany Project, archive it, or approve what waits in it — but cannot send a message or run a flow there unless she\nis also owner or editor. (Reading is the one part of that rule not yet closed in this build; see\nHow Nexi decides.)"},"391":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-113","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"NexGraph holds no rights of its own: it asks for the person's relation in the Project that owns the knowledge and\nturns it into the action table below. Two rules from the rest of the platform hold here word for word. *Administering\nis not reading*: an Organization Owner or Admin without a relation sees bindings, grants and run health as ids,\nkinds, states and counts — never a document name, a knowledge count or a page. And *a model never decides*: a\nclaim becomes *verified* or *falsified* through one door only, an oracle or a human curator."},"392":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-114","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"What"},"393":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-115","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"viewer · operator"},"394":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-116","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"editor"},"395":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-117","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"owner"},"396":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-118","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"agent member"},"397":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-119","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"admin without relation"},"398":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-120","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"Read the Overview, Studio, documents, claims, vocabulary; ask the knowledge graph in NexChat"},"399":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-121","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"400":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-122","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"401":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-123","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"402":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-124","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes, for the person"},"403":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-125","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"— (operational metadata only)"},"404":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-126","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"Open the original page, the item text, download the bytes"},"405":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-127","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes, within clearance"},"406":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-128","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes, within clearance"},"407":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-129","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relat