aph","content":"—"},"424":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-146","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes (the curator)"},"425":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-147","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"426":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-148","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"**never** — `403 AUTHOR_NOT_HUMAN`"},"427":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-149","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"428":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-150","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"Publish a vocabulary snapshot, change the capture policy"},"429":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-151","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"430":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-152","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"431":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-153","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"432":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-154","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"never"},"433":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-155","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"434":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-156","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"Publish a dataset version to NexBI"},"435":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-157","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"436":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-158","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"437":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-159","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"yes"},"438":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-160","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"never"},"439":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-161","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"—"},"440":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-162","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"Three things the table implies:"},"441":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-163","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"**Base-tier knowledge is nobody's to verify.** The platform documentation every organization receives is\nread-only; its claims have no *Verify* button for anyone, and it can be hidden for an organization but never\nedited."},"442":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-164","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"**Scope never widens rights.** *All knowledge* and *Project + organization* in Studio read the union of the\nProjects you hold a relation in, intersected with what each Project allows — and an answer in NexChat counts\nthe candidates outside your access without ever showing them."},"443":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-165","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"**Hidden and missing look the same.** A Project you have no relation in, a source above your clearance, a\nclaim in a Project you left: all `404`, so an id never reveals that something exists."},"444":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-166","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexgraph","content":"The *Effective rights for this object* block at the bottom of a claim's Verification tab shows the decision for the\nobject you are looking at — *Read the claim · Open the evidence · Verify claims* — with the line &#x2A;Why you see\nthis: your own Project relation.* Denials from the API come as `403 NOT_EDITOR`, `403 NOT_OWNER`,\n`403 AUTHOR_NOT_HUMAN` or `403 PEP_DENIED` with a `user_message_key`, never policy text; a policy outage is\n`503 POLICY_UNAVAILABLE`, never a yes."},"445":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-167","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"NexBI reads the person's relation in the Project that owns the data and applies it at every checkpoint of a governed\nquery — tenancy, metric, dataset and classification, then the **row policy before aggregation** — so two people with\nthe same relation and different clearances see different totals of the same dashboard. Two capabilities sit above the\nrelations: `bi_publish` (share and publish dashboards — owners hold it) and `metric_steward` (certify metrics,\nacknowledge a revocation — owners hold it until a steward is named)."},"446":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-168","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"What"},"447":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-169","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"viewer"},"448":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-170","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"editor"},"449":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-171","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"owner"},"450":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-172","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"agent (data arm, for the person)"},"451":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-173","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"admin without relation"},"452":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-174","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"Read dashboards, metrics, datasets, the query record; pin a version; export"},"453":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-175","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"yes, within clearance"},"454":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-176","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"yes"},"455":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-177","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"yes"},"456":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-178","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"describe · resolve · query **as the person**"},"457":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-179","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"— (counts and ids only)"},"458":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-180","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/a