ghts/roles-and-relations-214","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"—"},"493":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-215","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"yes (`overview.read`, ids only)"},"494":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-216","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"Three things the table implies:"},"495":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-217","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"**A block you may not see keeps its place.** The dashboard's layout is the same for everyone; the block reads *Not\navailable to you*. Denials are per block, never per dashboard."},"496":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-218","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"**The engine widens nothing.** A NexChat answer computed for you by the data arm runs under your relation, though\na service made the call — bi-api re-checks the asserted human."},"497":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-219","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-nexbi","content":"**Publishing and certification are acknowledgements.** *I have checked the numbers against their sources* and\n*I have reviewed the formula against the dataset schema* are recorded with the version; an agent cannot tick them."},"498":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-220","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"A **work project** in VibeBan is not a NexChat Project; it carries its own relations — `owner · editor · viewer ·\nagent_member` — granted by its owner, and personal items (`MY-n`) are shared person-to-person as viewer or editor.\nThe rule that makes VibeBan different: **an agent never outranks its principal**. An `agent_member` acts within the\nintersection of its own relation and the relation of the human it works for, and the sensitive actions are refused to\nany agent or service before OpenFGA is asked."},"499":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-221","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"What"},"500":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-222","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"viewer"},"501":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-223","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"editor · agent\\_member"},"502":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-224","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"human editor"},"503":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-225","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations#the-same-relations-in-vibeban","content":"owner"},"504":{"id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations-226","page_id":"/docs/access-rights/roles-and-relations","tags":[],"ty