-dashboard","content":"Publish dashboard"},"789":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-20","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#render-dashboard","content":"Render dashboard"},"790":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-21","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-dashboard-updates","content":"Get dashboard updates"},"791":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-22","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#share-dashboard","content":"Share dashboard"},"792":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-23","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#pin-dashboard","content":"Pin dashboard"},"793":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-24","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#export-dashboard","content":"Export dashboard"},"794":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-25","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-coverage","content":"Get coverage"},"795":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-26","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#list-suggestions","content":"List suggestions"},"796":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-27","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#apply-suggestion","content":"Apply suggestion"},"797":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-28","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#dismiss-suggestion","content":"Dismiss suggestion"},"798":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-29","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#list-dashboards","content":"Dashboards the caller may read (published + own drafts)."},"799":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-30","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#create-dashboard","content":"New draft — blank, from a template, from a plan or duplicated (references, never specs)."},"800":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-31","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#propose-dashboard","content":"the one proposal door — Canvas · Chat attachment · Data Scientist receipt · Data screen · Auto resolver propose_dashboard (platform tool bi.dashboard.propose runs as the initiating human). Reads the sources by reference through chat-api under the caller's actor context (FilePort), decides each table's publish rights with the PDP as the person (dry-run, advisory), proposes the model per table, chooses a template (bi.dashboard_proposal record) — WRITES NOTHING but the proposal and its record. 422 PROPOSAL_NO_SOURCE when every source is in cannot[]."},"801":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-32","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-dashboard-proposal","content":"The proposal as proposed — the card and the Studio Proposal panel read it; a proposal of a project the actor is not in is 404."},"802":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-33","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#accept-dashboard-proposal","content":"Accept (human-only, U1): publish each kept table the person may publish as a dataset version → add its proposed entity to the model → instantiate the Draft with the proposal's blocks and filters; idempotent on the proposal (a second accept returns the same dashboard_ref). A needs_request table becomes a waiting row with an ask to its granter (U3 a) — never a block. Outcome proposal_accepted (human_explicit) on the bi.dashboard_proposal and every bi.model_proposal record. 409 PROPOSAL_NOT_OPEN (accepted · declined · expired)."},"803":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-34","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#decline-dashboard-proposal","content":"Decline (human-only) → status declined, outcome proposal_rejected (human_explicit). 409 PROPOSAL_NOT_OPEN."},"804":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-35","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#mark-proposal-reviewed","content":"*Done reviewing* in the Studio (human-only, U4 a): clears Dashboard.proposal_ref, outcome proposal_reviewed with the blocks kept / removed as value (human_implicit). 409 PROPOSAL_NOT_ACCEPTED."},"805":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-36","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#propose-semantic-model","content":"infer one entity from a dataset version — a role per column with eligible roles, grains, cardinality (bi.model_proposal record, propensity 1.0) and the draft metrics that follow. Deterministic type/cardinality rules; no model. 422 NO_NUMERIC_OR_DATE_COLUMNS."},"806":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-37","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-semantic-model-proposal","content":"The model proposal behind a proposal source row (the Studio's 'why this role')."},"807":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-38","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#change-proposed-role","content":"The editor changes a proposed column role (human-only) — refused unless the role is in the column's eligible_roles (422 ROLE_NOT_ELIGIBLE); outcome role_changed (human_explicit) on the bi.model_proposal record; the entity in the model is updated when the proposal is already accepted."},"808":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-39","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#resolve-chart-encoding","content":"a Sandbox chart artifact's encoding as a BIQuery over its collected table — expressible (the table is published as an ads_result dataset version on first use, the artifact version gains query_ref) or not_expressible with a reason. The Canvas 'Add to dashboard' button asks this before it is enabled; POST …/blocks with artifact_ref runs it again server-side."},"809":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-40","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-dashboard","content":"Dashboard head with allowed_actions."},"810":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-41","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#update-dashboard","content":"Title, decision statement, filters, suggestion mode."},"811":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-42","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#archive-dashboard","content":"Archive (status archived; versions stay readable; automations unbound)."},"812":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-43","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#list-dashboard-versions","content":"History — every immutable version."},"813":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-44","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#get-dashboard-version","content":"One version (blocks as references)."},"814":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-45","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#save-draft","content":"Save the working draft (Studio *Save draft*): blocks are validated as references; 422 SPEC_COPY_REJECTED; 409 ARTIFACT_FOREIGN_PROJECT."},"815":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-46","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#add-block","content":"Canvas ⋯ → *Add to dashboard*: first free slot, recommended size; the artifact must belong to the Project."},"816":{"id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards-47","page_id":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/bi/dashboards#publish-dashboard","content":"Publish the draft as the new published versio