dence, page renders and the original bytes — each behind the same rights check."},"1249":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-1","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-document-items","content":"List document items"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-2","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-page-render","content":"Get page render"},"1251":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-3","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#download-source-version","content":"Download source version"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-4","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-item-text","content":"Get item text"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-5","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-evidence-span","content":"Get evidence span"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-6","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-claim-evidence","content":"Get claim evidence"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-7","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-document-view","content":"Get document view"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-8","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-page-items","content":"List page items"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-9","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-document-view-all","content":"Get document view all"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-10","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-page-items-all","content":"List page items all"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-11","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-document-items","content":"Evidence Workspace structure (query: kind, page, cursor). Text arrives as previews; full text by item text_ref through getItemText."},"1260":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-12","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-page-render","content":"Page render (PNG) with Content-Disposition: attachment — the original page is primary in the Evidence Workspace. Never a presigned URL."},"1261":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-13","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#download-source-version","content":"Original bytes with Content-Disposition: attachment, PEP-checked with classification clearance. Audited."},"1262":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-14","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-item-text","content":"Allowed text of one DocumentItem (chunk/paragraph/cell) — the ONLY way text leaves graph-api on the read path; the agent runtime reads EvidenceBundle items through this call."},"1263":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-15","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-evidence-span","content":"One EvidenceSpan with precision and page labels."},"1264":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-16","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-claim-evidence","content":"Spans, source versions, contributing sources and the deciding OracleRun of a claim — the Inspector's Evidence tab. Derived-conclusion rule: the caller must be allowed on ALL derived_from_source_refs unless an independently allowed source suffices; otherwise 404."},"1265":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-17","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-document-view","content":"additive — the Evidence Workspace read model of one SourceVersion in one call: version · binding · last run · outline (pages, sections, tables, figures as previews, never text) · counts · coverage · the bounded mention list (each with `pdf_page`) · the entities they resolve to. Text leaves only through listPageItems. Denied and foreign-tenant alike → 404; clearance below the version's classification → 404."},"1266":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-18","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-page-items","content":"additive — the Silver text of one page (query: page; or offset/limit over the document) with the evidence spans and mentions that sit on the returned items. This is checkpoint 5 for the page sheet: PEP `object.read` on the version + classification clearance; the per-item listDocumentItems/getItemText pair stays for clients that need one item."},"1267":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-19","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#get-document-view-all","content":"additive — the **All knowledge** view ( `project_plus_org`, c): no Project in the path = every Project the caller holds a relation on (the PEP's set, never a client list) plus the platform's `base` tier. Read-only; edits stay on the Project routes. The Evidence Workspace read model opened from the All view — same checkpoints as getDocumentView."},"1268":{"id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence-20","page_id":"/docs/api/graph/evidence","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/api/graph/evidence#list-page-items-all","content":"additive — the **All knowledge** view ( `project_plus_org`, c): no Project in the path = every Project the caller holds a relation on (the PEP's set, never a client list) plus the platform's `base` tier. Read-only; edits stay on the Project routes. Page text from the All view — same checkpoints as listPageItems (PEP `object.read` + clearance)."},"1269":{"id":"/docs/api/grap