ontent":"VibeBan and NexBI — on the laptop today, in the release images next"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/deploy-5","page_id":"/docs/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/deploy#the-modules-and-the-speech-sidecars--profiles-off-by-default","content":"The modules and the speech sidecars — profiles, off by default"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/deploy-6","page_id":"/docs/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/deploy#what-differs-between-targets","content":"What differs between targets"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/deploy-7","page_id":"/docs/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/deploy#before-you-start","content":"Before you start"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/deploy-8","page_id":"/docs/deploy","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/deploy#three-rules-that-never-change","content":"Three rules that never change"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/deploy-9","page_id":"/docs/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deploy","content":"Nexi is built to be deployed **once, the same way, everywhere**. One set of signed container images, one Helm\nchart, one Compose file and one environment contract cover every target — your laptop, a single server, an on-prem\ncluster, a managed cloud cluster. What differs between them is *only* configuration: where the database lives,\nwho holds the secrets, how the public edge terminates TLS. Agents, Skills, Flows, policies and connections you\nbuild on one target run unchanged on the next."},"1768":{"id":"/docs/deploy-10","page_id":"/docs/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deploy","content":"This section walks up that ladder one rung at a time. Each page is complete on its own; read them in order if you\nare new to the platform, or jump to the target you need."},"1769":{"id":"/docs/deploy-11","page_id":"/docs/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deploy#the-ladder","content":"Rung"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/deploy-12","page_id":"/docs/deploy","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/deploy#the-ladder","content":"Page"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/depl