ector (identity · facts · case · journey; one primary — *Create case*). Not a kit duplicate: `TurnCard` (DS-5xxx) is NexChat's own turn; a care timeline has two parties and a tool lane."},"2994":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts-6","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts#in-the-workshop","content":"Also: summary · reply · inspector"},"2995":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts-7","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts#states","content":"`thread` · `summary` · `reply` · `read-only` · `inspector`"},"2996":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts-8","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/conversation-parts#accessibility","content":"the timeline is a `list` of labelled entries; the composer is a `form` with the mode as a radiogroup; the inspector is `complementary` and returns focus on close"},"2997":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks","type":"page","content":"Dashboard blocks","breadcrumbs":["Nexi Docs","Design system","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks"},"2998":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks-0","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks","content":"What NexBI owns: the block card (title · figure or chart · the *Data* twin · the trace door; studio adds the selection ring and the handles), the 12-column grid it sits on (drag · "},"2999":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks-1","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/dashboard-blocks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"