"url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#in-the-workshop","content":"In the workshop"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-2","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#states","content":"States"},"3188":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-3","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"3189":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-4","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","content":"**DS-6107** · `apps/sales/src/components/parts/LogInteractionForm.tsx#LogInteractionForm` · proposed"},"3190":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-5","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","content":"The interaction is written **in the activity stream**, not in a side panel (proposed 2026-10-11, replacing the S0 FormInspector — the owner found the page overloaded with the panel open). Closed, it is one quiet line at the top of *Activity* — `+ Log a call, a meeting or a note…`. Open, it is one bordered block: a head (title · `×`), one row of four compact fields — kind · contact · when · outcome (`Field` + `Select compact`) — the summary (the only required field; its hint is the placeholder), an optional *Plan the next step* switch that reveals *next step · due*, and a footer where the save ladder (DS-6102) sits at the left and *Cancel · Save* (`Button size=\"toolbar\"`) at the right. The header's *Log interaction* opens the same composer. With AI off the last line says so (08). Esc closes while nothing is in flight; the composer closes itself once the source confirmed the write. Built on `Field` · `Select` · `Switch` · `Button` · `IconButton` · `Hint`. Not a kit duplicate: `FormInspector` (DS-3032) is a panel; `EditBar` (DS-3033) has no fields."},"3191":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-6","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#in-the-workshop","content":"Also: draft · saving · waiting-for-source · saved · pending-approval · rejected · conflict · not-saved · unavailable · read-only"},"3192":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-7","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#states","content":"`closed-line` · `draft` · `saving` · `pending_external` · `saved` · `pending_approval` · `rejected` · `conflict` · `not_saved` · `unavailable` · `denied`"},"3193":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer-8","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/log-composer#accessibility","content":"a `form` labelled by its title; the summary takes focus on open; the required field is announced on submit; Esc returns focus to the opener; the ladder is the `role=status` of the write"},"3194":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu","type":"page","content":"Menu","breadcrumbs":["Nexi Docs","Design system","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/menu"},"3195":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu-0","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/menu","content":"The ⋯ for secondary actions."},"3196":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu-1","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/menu#in-the-workshop","content":"In the workshop"},"3197":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/menu-2","page_id":"/docs/de