n-the-workshop","content":"In the workshop"},"3333":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page-2","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page#states","content":"States"},"3334":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page-3","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","content":"**DS-6103** · `apps/sales/src/components/screens/TodayScreen.tsx#TodayScreen` · adopted"},"3335":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page-4","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","content":"Today is an instance of the **Overview page** (DS-7006, the NexCore cockpit — amended 2026-10-11 twice: the owner found three columns overloaded, then asked for the NexCore Overview idiom): a `wide` frame with the health line in the header (`StatusDot` + small age, as NexCore's *operational*); the **Sales pulse** frame (`PulseStrip` — Accounts ─ Opportunities ─ Quotes waiting ─ Follow-ups, each a door; `live` when the provider is connected; the foot line: planned · waiting · overdue · going quiet); three `Stat`s (planned today · open pipeline as money · going quiet, with overdue as the toned delta); then two `nexus-cc-two` rows of `Section`s — *Planned today* (`StatusList`: account · kind · contact · time, row → account with the Log composer open) · *Waiting on me* (the attention list: title · account · assignee · due, dot red when overdue, the task reference as the door to NexTasks) · *Going quiet* (`StatusList`: account · relationship · owner · *n d quiet*, amber ≥30 d, red ≥60 d) · *Recent* (the recent list: who · kind · account · outcome · ago). Only kit classes; no app-local stylesheet. The org-admin sees the pulse figures and the quiet empty state, never the lists."},"3336":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page-5","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page#in-the-workshop","content":"Also: native · hand-over · setup-door · org-admin · loading · error · denied · offline"},"3337":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page-6","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/sales-today-overview-page#states","content":"`populated-connected` · `populated-native` · `empty-setup-door` · `org-admin-d423` · `loading` · `error` · `denied` · `offline`"},"3338":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","type":"page","content":"Save ladder","breadcrumbs":["Nexi Docs","Design system","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder"},"3339":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-0","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","content":"The honest state of one write, in the log composer's footer (DS-6107; a FormInspector's footer elsewhere — amended 2026-10-11): draft · saving · waiting for ‹provider› · pending ap"},"3340":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-1","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder#in-the-workshop","content":"In the workshop"},"3341":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-2","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder#states","content":"States"},"3342":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-3","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"3343":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-4","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","content":"**DS-6102** · `apps/sales/src/components/parts/SaveLadder.tsx#SaveLadder` · adopted"},"3344":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-5","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","content":"The honest state of one write, in the log composer's footer (DS-6107; a FormInspector's footer elsewhere — amended 2026-10-11): draft · saving · waiting for ‹provider› · pending approval (names the approver) · saved (said only when the source confirmed and returned an id) · rejected (names the field) · conflict (mine · theirs; *Keep mine* · *Take theirs* · *Merge*) · reconciling · not saved (*Try again*) · ‹provider› unavailable · denied (read-only record type). A dot + sentence; `role=\"status\"`, polite for the quiet states, assertive for the ones that need a hand. Not a kit duplicate: `EditBar` (DS-3033) has editing/saving only; the ladder is the write-through contract of a system of record."},"3345":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-6","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder#in-the-workshop","content":"Also: saving · pending-external · pending-approval · saved · saved-native · rejected · conflict · reconciling · not-saved · unavailable · denied"},"3346":{"id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder-7","page_id":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/design-system/components/save-ladder#states","content":"`draft` · `saving` · `pending_external` · `pending_approval` · `saved` · `rejected` ·