,"content":"a conversation channel connected in NexCore › Synapse"},"7261":{"id":"/docs/technical/synapse-72","page_id":"/docs/technical/synapse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/synapse#where-you-meet-synapse","content":"Next in this series: **why the ontology matters** — how Nexi describes every model, tool and technology it uses,\nand what it can automate because it does."},"7262":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"page","content":"The big picture","breadcrumbs":["Nexi Docs","Technical documentation"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture"},"7263":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-0","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","content":"Nexi decomposed on one page — the applications, what each one contains, the runtimes they all share and the state underneath — with the map you can click through."},"7264":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-1","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#one-suite-several-applications-one-runtime","content":"One suite, several applications, one runtime"},"7265":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-2","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Reading the map top to bottom"},"7266":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-3","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#inside-nexchat--what-contains-what","content":"Inside NexChat — what contains what"},"7267":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-4","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#how-the-parts-call-each-other","content":"How the parts call each other"},"7268":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-5","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#where-things-live","content":"Where things live"},"7269":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-6","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#three-ways-to-read-this-page","content":"Three ways to read this page"},"7270":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-7","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#one-suite-several-applications-one-runtime","content":"Nexi (the platform formerly named NEXUS) is not one application. It is a **suite**: several applications with one shell, one sign-in and one set of\nagents, standing on **one governed runtime** — and a set of **modules**, applications an organization turns on from\nNexCore when it needs them (NexMap, NexCare, NexForge). The map below is the whole thing, top to bottom. Click an item to read\nwhat it is; the arrow takes you to the page that explains it."},"7271":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-8","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#one-suite-several-applications-one-runtime","content":"The same decomposition as an **architecture view** — one of the views of the single model that also draws\nHow Nexi is built. Double-click an application to open it; NexChat opens into the picture\nfurther down."},"7272":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-9","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"**Applications** are what people open. Each has one job and its own nouns:"},"7273":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-10","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Application"},"7274":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-11","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Job"},"7275":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-12","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Its nouns"},"7276":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-13","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Status"},"7277":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-14","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"**NexHome**"},"7278":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-15","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Land, find, jump."},"7279":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-16","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Launcher, recent context, global search"},"7280":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-17","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Available"},"7281":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-18","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"**NexChat**"},"7282":{"id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture-19","page_id":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/technical/the-big-picture#reading-the-map-top-to-bottom","content":"Do the work; build the agents that help. Auto picks the capability; the Resolver proposes a plan when nothing fits."},"728