e person does next is its label — and it is written to the same\nrecord, never inferred later:"],[6996,"A row pointing at a Flow the person owns (`flow_ref`), of kind *refresh · metric\\_alert · subscription*, with schedule and params."],[4555,"A run does not only leave tables and charts. The cleaned data it produced stays in the Project as **datasets**, so\nthe next question does not start from the workbook again."],[230,"A run of an agent acting on a person's behalf inside a Project."],[5994,"A run whose state is **Failed** or **Partial** shows **Retry failed stages** in its header (owners and editors).\nThe panel names the **Stage** and the **Source version** and says: &#x2A;Previous results are kept; the rerun is\nidempotent — no duplicate claims, observations or tasks.* After it, the run reads &#x2A;New attempt linked to the same\nsource version.*"],[26,"A run you may watch but not decide"],[808,"a Sandbox chart artifact's encoding as a BIQuery over its collected table — expressible (the table is published as an ads_result dataset version on first use, the artifact version gains query_ref) or not_expressible with a reason. The Canvas 'Add to dashboard' button asks this before it is enabled; POST …/blocks with artifact_ref runs it again server-side."],[7117,"a saved view opened"],[5618,"A scene you can edit, in **Board** view for the first steps."],[3860,"A screen composes the kit. A new idiom — a new chip, a new panel, a new table — goes through the register as a Design Change Request before code; a duplicate of a kit component in an app is a fitness failure."],[2527,"A screen is composed of registered components; a new idiom proposes a register row before code; a component without\na story does not exist."],[3816,"A screen's content region renders through `DataStateView`; loading is text, empty is quiet with ≤ 3 starting points, error and offline retry, denied and not found look alike. Tables render their own ladder inside the body."],[3812,"A screen's content