s chapter has no\nscreen yet: listing a work domain after creation. The **Settings → Organization** form exists but is not connected to\nthe server in this version, so the owner's administrator used the API; the create form's **Work domain** field is\nthe way to avoid the round-trip."],[967,"All versions, ascending (content included — versions are small validated specs)"],[847,"All versions, newest first, incl. revoked (addressable, never served)."],[1262,"Allowed text of one DocumentItem (chunk/paragraph/cell) — the ONLY way text leaves graph-api on the read path; the agent runtime reads EvidenceBundle items through this call."],[3297,"Also: a-one-line-request · a-packing-list · the-gate · the-reply-and-the-options · the-formula-sheet · the-handoff"],[2867,"Also: archive-used-by-unavailable"],[3104,"Also: asked · working · waiting-on-you · waiting-on-other · done · stopped · failed · nothing-found · the-edges · reach-beyond-what-exists · did-we-check-our-own-system · the-authoring-harness"],[3501,"Also: asked · working · waiting-on-you · waiting-on-other · stopped · failed · nothing-found"],[3240,"Also: boards-native · boards-two · board-hidden · no-board · no-board-cannot-act · tasks-away · leads · requests · empty · loading · error · denied · offline"],[3170,"Also: buttons"],[3045,"Also: cannot-edit · editing · with-error · dirty-cancel"],[3004,"Also: chart · block · filter-bar-parts · grid-editable"],[3159,"Also: collapsed · expanded · with-copy"],[3533,"Also: controls · layers · shortcuts · hover"],[3404,"Also: default"],[3223,"Also: dense-wide · long-title · stacked"],[3191,"Also: draft · saving · waiting-for-source · saved · pending-approval · rejected · conflict · not-saved · unavailable · read-only"],[2905,"Also: empty · composing · streaming · answered-from-screen · not-on-screen · unreadable · action-proposed · action-done · error · denied · offline · no-destination · no-route · on-a-list-screen · on-an-account · on-today · offline · on-a-list-screen · on