s clearance are\nabsent from the page **and** from `X-Nexus-Artifacts-Total`. Another Project's artifacts are never listed.\nAn unknown value for `type` · `created_by_kind` · `status` is 422, never ignored. `q` matches the title only\n(case- and diacritic-insensitive prefix / word), never content. Default `status` is *not archived*."],[6457,"Artifacts, *published*; pinned as Project sources with a shape hint"],[6460,"Artifacts, never published by the gate"],[6454,"Artifacts, versioned, on the Canvas"],[6466,"Artifacts, versioned; grows with later runs"],[4087,"As a viewer, **New automation** is absent; `POST …/automations` answers *403*."],[6633,"as above"],[4118,"As an editor, **Publish** is absent; the API answers *403* on `…/publish`."],[6465,"as any document — draft to editors, published to all"],[3106,"as DS-5001; the plan's steps are a list, the decisions are buttons in Tab order; earlier results fold under a disclosure button with `aria-expanded`; the Situation strip is a list whose doors are links in Tab order; the Next line is one `nav` landmark labelled *Next*; the security table is a definition list"],[4140,"As the Project owner, press **Certify**."],[5037,"Ask *search the web for the latest on Apache AGE 1.6*; then the same on a thread without a connected key; then on a\n**secret** thread."],[5001,"Ask &#x2A;What was the late delivery rate by carrier in 2026?* in a Project that has a NexBI dataset."],[458,"Ask a data question in NexChat"],[70,"Ask a Project owner or an administrator to enable it; nothing is broken."],[5844,"Ask a question in a Project chat and get an answer grounded in the knowledge graph — numbered sources with their kind, tier and claim status, and a Grounding drawer that shows how each source was found. About ten minutes."],[4034,"Ask a question in a Project thread and let Auto route it to NexBI — a direct answer computed by the governed query engine, with drafts you can open in the Canvas, pin to a dashboard, or turn into a proposed 