n NexChat: the Project's **Agents**, **Skills** and **Flows**\nscreens (see the NexChat guide)."],[838,"Correct dataset cell"],[851,"Correct one cell → a NEW version with source.kind=correction, mandatory reason, visible marker; the NexGraph claim is untouched (T12). Human only."],[4178,"Correcting a cell adds **v2 · Current** to Versions and marks **v1 · Superseded**; the dashboard KPI that follows the latest version shows the new number after its next render."],[852,"Correction history of a dataset."],[510,"counts and ids only (*Content hidden*)"],[7740,"counts only"],[7739,"counts only; no audio, no text"],[1678,"Coverage counts per kind and RTM percentages — the References screen header and the Overview's *reference coverage*."],[511,"Create · edit · move · assign · link items; plan an iteration; edit a milestone; attach a reference; write a project update"],[1618,"Create (editor+). Emits `nexus.tasks.milestone.created.v1`."],[5229,"Create *Autumn catalogue* in NexChat, find it in Core, read its five tabs and inherited policy, grant Taras *editor* and Kate *viewer*, and see what a non-member sees before and after."],[1448,"Create / replace an organization or project layer (admin; PepAction=administer). Base / domain / regulatory layers arrive only via signed packs. Validator rejects any loosening of the parent (tool allowlist grows, sandbox limit grows, cloud threshold rises, approval threshold rises)."],[939,"Create / replace the agent's ToolBinding for one tool (human authors only)\n\nThe tool must be *available* to the agent's Project (see GET /chat/projects/{id}/tools) — otherwise 422\nwith `tool.unavailable.<reason>`. Constraints may only narrow the definition (`approval` tightens,\n`constraints.max_classification` ≤ `classification_max`); integration/custom tools need a `connection_id`.\nEmits `nexus.chat.agent.tool.bound.v1`."],[1231,"Create / replace the agent's ToolBinding for one tool (human authors only)\n\nThe tool must be *available* to the agent's 